Package: eqty.sdk.r
Title: Verifiable Provenance for R Workflows
Version: 0.9.0
Authors@R: person("Support", "EQTY Lab", email = "package-management@eqtylab.io", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides an R interface for building verifiable manifests around
    data, models, prompts, agents, computations, and related lineage. Exposes
    the public 'eqty-sdk' Python package through R-accessible types for creating
    assets, connecting computation inputs and outputs by content identifier,
    grouping statements in contexts, and exporting manifest JSON files.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    reticulate (>= 1.41)
SystemRequirements: Python (>= 3.10)
URL: https://github.com/eqtylab/integrity-r,
    https://eqtylab.github.io/integrity-py/latest/,
    https://pypi.org/project/eqty-sdk/
BugReports: https://github.com/eqtylab/integrity-r/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
